{
  "Helps GPS module to lock on to a satellite signal. \n\nA-GPS could reduce TTFF (time-to-first-fix), startup period especially where the satellite signal is weak or distorted by surroundings."
  "帮助GPS模块锁定卫星信号。\n\n辅助全球定位系统（A-GPS）可缩短首次定位时间（TTFF, time-to-first-fix）和启动时间，尤其在卫星信号较弱或受周围环境干扰的情况下。"
}
{
  "Android system on some devices gives possibility to manage and refresh a-gps data manually."
  "部分设备上的安卓系统支持手动管理和刷新A-GPS数据。"
}
{
  "If your GPS fix time is long. You can refresh a-gps data. This could improve your fix time and signal quality."
